This is a '''list of quotes by Reyna when {{abi text|Empress}} is activated''', having a filter applied to them. Reyna is voiced by Karina Altamirano in English. Necessary quotes translated are from Spanish to English, unless otherwise stated. There are a few voice lines unique to Empress (marked with †). The Empress set contains {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Reyna Empress Quotes}} quotes.

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tAVPVmtpjDeZmbI8ZDQKPsMg3wssBvbk?usp=sharing here]. For the standard set, see [[Reyna/Quotes]].

